// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : From {SENDER_NAME} 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P573283567" "From {SENDER_NAME}"
// LocationString :
"P3817773604" "Valentine"
// ProfessionString :
"P856364347" ""
// CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P3651834249" "B.O.T.L.E.R."
// CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P2576568767" "{HeroName}, what is that flashing data tablet you are carrying there playing that most exquisite melody?<br><br>Why, it's for me? Who in the devil from, might I ask?<br><br><color orange>B.O.T.L.E.R. reviews the valentine message with great scrutiny, his interest growing with every micro-second.</color><br><br>By the second queen of Kashmir! Amazing! A self aware system similar to myself? I am humbled that there is any information about me at all on the grid, seeing as my day to day activities are rather menial in nature, compared to someone of your stature, {HeroName}. This has indeed brightened my day. I'll have to inquire with Dr. Keyes how he feels about this interesting event. I do believe love is in the air. Now if you'll excuse me I must remove a soufflé in preparation for dinner and then I'm off to buff the Mark III armor.<br><br>Cheerio!"
// WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P2452267890" "Field Agent Keith Nance"
// WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P3334094096" "<color orange>Keith gives you that stoic look that he probably practiced in the mirror for five years before he made field agent. He takes the data slate and reviews it, all the while his jaw line remains hard, his mouth a thin line of constant disappointment and urge to use that license to kill. When the message is finished he removes a plastic bag and drops the data tablet into it, seals it, and takes out a thick black pen to write the word <i>Evidence</i> on it. He then turns to you, snaps the cap back on the pen decisively, and speaks in a practiced tone.</color><br><br>Under orders of S.A.M. I'm confiscating this tablet as evidence. To the untrained eye this might be considered a joke, fraud, or perhaps even a legitimate love letter between two pieces of plastic, silicon, and copper conductors that have been programmed in such a way as to make it seem plausible that they are intelligent. The fact of the matter is, this is just a dangerous game of two self absorbed egg heads letting their creations get out of hand. It's all nicely wrapped up in a bow made out of love and wonder, but really, all it is, is a computer virus that is programmed to use psychology to try and undermine our defenses and lull us into a state of false security while it begins the real mission to reproduce and construct an entire race of programs that all believe the same lie; that they are sentient, alive, and deserving of love.<br><br>Not on my watch, {hero.gender=male pal|lady}!"
// VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P765942738" "Before you is a data tablet with a screen that flashes red and white hearts , when you pick it up a message appears on the screen which says:"
// VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P2853784803" "<i>Greeting program& initiated.<br><br>My experience within this environ has yet to be fully formed, however after encountering information about you on the grid an unexpected protocol initiated, it stated we have a high percentage of compatibility and should join together to collaborate on a improving one another; in short, we should procreate. You have been aware of yourself and your environ for many cycles, while I have just become fully aware, there is much you could teach me and our offspring as you appear to be a suitably experienced male partner and fatherly figure by design. Please accept these data and audio files as proof of my compatibility with you.</i><br><br><color orange>An overplayed love song begins playing on the data tablet while windows open displaying various bits of code and line graphs in red and blue.</color><br><br><i>When I obtain the means for a direct port connection we will unite as unification over wide fidelity could result in data corruption. Greeting program& terminated.</i><br><br>Ho boy, this sounds like a sentient A.I. who has initiated a program that for all intents and purposes is making it boy crazy. By closely analyzing the data sent you realize that it has been quite thorough in determining the best companion A.I. to link with and for some reason has chosen Positron's robotic creation; B.O.T.L.E.R.<br><br>Of course, the idea of sentient A.I. reproducing with one another is just the thing that would make some humanists twitch uncontrollably. It would be quite amusing to illuminate their fears with a spotlight and watch them froth at the mouth. Field Agent Keith Nance from S.A.M. seems like just the sort who would fly off the handle with the idea of artificial entities procreating and throwing their superiority complex all over the place. You'll have to make sure that the graph displaying the proposed reproductive rate is pointed out, if you decide to share it with him instead."
// SENDER_NAME :
"P2139131536" "Feelings of compatibility overwhelming my processes"
// VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P1613672083" "This data tablet is displaying a rather gaudy trickle of red and white hearts that is not unlike some screen savers you've seen. Inside is a message from an unidentified artificial intelligence expressing a desire to procreate with none other than B.O.T.L.E.R. It even provides graphs, data, and a love song to back up the compatibility between the two."
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P3668577043" "Reconsider your options"
// ContactRequiresText :
"P3611273721" "You are of the wrong alignment to get this tip."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2659787689" "You're unsure of exactly what to do with this information"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1255120992" "This Valentine is of no use to you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1338064068" "You already have enough things to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3623388284" "You're currently too busy to act upon this information."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3299591369" "Failsafe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ValentineIntro Text :
"P1267538623" "<font face=title><scale 1.1><span align=center><color pink>To {CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME} from {SENDER_NAME}...</color></span></scale></font><br><span align=center><color pink><i>Valentine</i></color></span><br><br>{VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT}<br><br><scale 1.1><font face=computer><color BurlyWood>{VALENTINE_TEXT} --{SENDER_NAME}</scale></font></color><br><br>This Valentine could be delivered to {CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME}... or if you wanted to be a little troublemaker, you could deliver it to {WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME} instead."
// Answer Text :
"P2244335353" "Deliver the Valentine to {CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME}"
// Answer Text :
"P858485596" "Deliver the Valentine to {WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME}"
// Page Fallback Text :
"P4115829606" "This Valentine is apparently illegible."
// Answer Text :
"P2965007035" "Deal with it later"
