"P2430933739" "Ja, I joost luff the springtime."
// WRONG_DELIVERY_LOCATION :
"P747639939" "Dr. Aeon's Sekrit Lab"
// WRONG_DELIVERY_INACTIVE :
"P228378272" "Zowie wow! Aeon needs a BFF, if you know what I mean...<t 2>Too many lonely nights with just the Television for company..."
